<title>AUSTRALIA: Aussie Home Loans cuts fixed rate home loans.</title>
<headline>Aussie Home Loans cuts fixed rate home loans.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mortgage originator Aussie Home Loans said on Friday it had cut rates on its two, three, four and five year fixed rate home loans by up to 0.4 percent.</p>
</text>
